%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5a584a25f7a2f6c23a420ed9d0c79f73, type: 3}
  m_Name: npc_tamsin
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: AthenHill.Runtime::AthenHill.NpcDefinition
  id: npc_tamsin
  displayName: Tamsin
  role: Field Supply
  entries:
  - node: first_visit
    requires: "!flag:tamsin_met"
  nodes:
  - id: first_visit
    title: Field Supply
    text: Mind the step. Tamsin, Field Supply. Twenty years outfitting Karaveen caravans before my knees voted to stay in Ward. Packs on the wall, medkits and nano cells under the counter, and the magazine shelf by the window. Fabricators swear by it.
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - id: shop
      label: Show me the stock.
      next: 
      action: shop
      requires: 
      setFlag: tamsin_met
    - id: magazines
      label: What's on the magazine shelf?
      next: magazines
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: tamsin_met
    - id: close
      label: Another time.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: tamsin_met
  - id: greeting
    title: Field Supply
    text: Back again. New issues on the shelf, fresh cells under the counter. What are we carrying today?
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - id: shop
      label: Let me see the stock.
      next: 
      action: shop
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: packs
      label: Which pack should I carry?
      next: packs
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: supplies
      label: Medkits and nano cells?
      next: supplies
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: magazines
    title: The magazine shelf
    text: Digital issues from the fab co-op and the Karaveen freight houses. Download one to your slate and Brann's bench in Salvage can make what's inside. Rucksacks, frame packs, pouches, hip belts, even armour liners. Cheaper than buying, if you can scavenge the webbing.
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - id: shop
      label: Show me the shelf.
      next: 
      action: shop
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: packs
      label: And the packs?
      next: packs
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: close
      label: Later.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: packs
    title: Packs
    text: Weight's the real limit, not room. A frame pack puts the load on your hips, so you carry more, not just stuff more in. The low tech ones you can patch yourself. The mid-tier rigs want fab alloy and servos. Every pack has sockets for pouches, and the frames take a belt or a lifter.
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - id: shop
      label: Show me the packs.
      next: 
      action: shop
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: supplies
      label: Medkits and nano cells?
      next: supplies
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: close
      label: Thanks, Tamsin.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: supplies
    title: Med and nano
    text: Medkits patch you up mid-fight, press 2. The trauma kit closes worse. A nano cell refills your weapon and overclocks the regulator, so the charge keeps coming back while you fire, press 9. The surge pack runs hotter and longer.
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - id: shop
      label: I'll take some.
      next: 
      action: shop
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: magazines
      label: Tell me about the magazines.
      next: magazines
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: close
      label: Good to know.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  shop:
    title: Field Supply
    subtitle: "Tamsin \xB7 Packs, med and nano, magazines"
    supplies: 1
    parts: 0
    salvage: 0
    stockTags:
    - field_supply
    excludeTags: []
    magazines: 1
